<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt/105% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center">The accompanying notes are an integral part of
these unaudited financial statements.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt/105% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt/105% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center">&#160;</p>


