<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 9.75pt 0 0; text-align: justify">As of September 30, 2023, the weighted-average
remaining lease terms of the two operating leases were <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1_iI_dtY_c20230930__us-gaap--LeaseContractualTermAxis__custom--LeaseOneMember_zP0RfBDeIVT2" title="Weighted-average remaining lease term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_LeaseOneMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1">3.2</ix:nonNumeric></span> years and <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1_iI_dtY_c20230930__us-gaap--LeaseContractualTermAxis__custom--LeaseTwoMember_z73WQE7Fktp" title="Weighted-average remaining lease term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_LeaseTwoMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1">5.2</ix:nonNumeric></span> years, respectively. The weighted-average discount rates for
the operating leases were <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent_iI_dp_c20230930__us-gaap--LeaseContractualTermAxis__custom--LeaseOneMember_zE0XSDsT3Pw" title="Weighted-average discount rates"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_LeaseOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.57</ix:nonFraction></span>% and <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent_iI_dp_c20230930__us-gaap--LeaseContractualTermAxis__custom--LeaseTwoMember_z2Yg47YONaIe" title="Weighted-average discount rates"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_LeaseTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.24</ix:nonFraction></span>%, respectively.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 9.75pt 0 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

