    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-bottom: 2.5pt">Options outstanding at September 30, 2023</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-bottom: 2.5pt">&#160;</td>
